{"1151380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cowboy Life Simulator", "steam_appid": 1151380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>ROADMAP!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/0a9812b580482d9c8d95a39962b05b69.avif?t=1788118475\" width=1100 height=2508 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Cowboy Life Simulator</strong> is an immersive and relaxing single-player Wild West ranching simulator. Step into the boots of a stressed-out businessman who, after a failed venture, decides to change his life and buys a farm in the Wild West. Purchase your first goat and a bag of grain, get to know the local community, and explore diverse, vibrant locations.<br>Run your ranch and discover what this wild frontier has to offer!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/59f3f32275ddfcd05b94d1508fc29a1b.poster.avif?t=1788118475\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/59f3f32275ddfcd05b94d1508fc29a1b.webm?t=1788118475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/59f3f32275ddfcd05b94d1508fc29a1b.mp4?t=1788118475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/b07771ea9e3078a3709a845667247418.avif?t=1788118475\" /></span></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Immersive Open World</strong> – Travel across a map filled with diverse locations, uncover its secrets, and face challenges.</li><li><strong>Ranch Building</strong> – Build your own ranch, construct utility buildings, farms, and decorations.</li><li><strong>Farming &amp; Animal Caretaking</strong> – Plant, tend to, and harvest over 20 different crops, and take care of your farm animals.</li><li><strong>Crafting</strong> – Create essential items for survival and ranch management.</li><li><strong>Decorating</strong> – Decorate your home to your taste with everyday items like an axe or cans of food.</li><li><strong>Engaging Storylines</strong> – Dive into the extensive history of Bravestand and its surroundings, getting to know your neighbors, near and far, through engaging quests.</li><li><strong>Interesting Characters</strong> – Chat with colorful Wild West inhabitants and become part of the local community.</li><li><strong>Mysteries to Unfold</strong> – Discover the secrets and dilemmas of Bravestand's residents and find out what awaits you in even the most distant corners of the map.</li><li><strong>Sophisticated Progression</strong> – Develop your character's skills and level up in the unique Farm, Fame, Frontier experience system.</li><li><strong>Light Survival</strong> – Collect resources scattered across the map and pay attention to your character's needs.</li><li><strong>Combat</strong> – Shoot various available weapons, upgrade them, and use them to fight animals and gangs terrorizing the area.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/a3f11a8c511cab00a2070fbdc5deeb22.avif?t=1788118475\" width=800 height=31 /></span><br><br>The Wild West is teeming with life, especially the small town of Bravestand. Each resident has their habits, favorite places, and problems. Make friends with them, learn the history and life of the town by helping solve the problems of your new neighbors and local residents. Help out and strengthen the bonds of friendship, and you'll gain not only good neighbors but also devoted friends!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/14c05dc98e906c8dde524433fdaab0cf.poster.avif?t=1788118475\" width=676 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/14c05dc98e906c8dde524433fdaab0cf.webm?t=1788118475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/14c05dc98e906c8dde524433fdaab0cf.mp4?t=1788118475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/7fd16b239b7eb866fe659400fba3e89a.avif?t=1788118475\" width=800 height=31 /></span><br><br>Run your ranch in your own style. You decide where your house will stand, where the goat pen will be, and where you'll sow grain and plant cabbage. Create your own corner of the Wild West with many available decorations and buildings. Run your ranch your way, take care of animals, and plant diverse crops. Trade with town residents to get new recipes and gain access to unknown resources.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/0559f9811efe3c45fc679cede1f47b1b.poster.avif?t=1788118475\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/0559f9811efe3c45fc679cede1f47b1b.webm?t=1788118475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/0559f9811efe3c45fc679cede1f47b1b.mp4?t=1788118475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/faf8b9d51965a54899659175d7abfc04.avif?t=1788118475\" width=800 height=31 /></span><br><br>And after a day's work on the ranch, pull out your revolver and hop on your horse to seek adventure in the farthest corners of the Wild West, uncovering its most hidden secrets! Find out what lurks in the abandoned mine and what's the deal with that giant rock?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/c00c9a305969774afe0a7ddf686bba05.poster.avif?t=1788118475\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/c00c9a305969774afe0a7ddf686bba05.webm?t=1788118475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/c00c9a305969774afe0a7ddf686bba05.mp4?t=1788118475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the Cowboy Community!</h2><br>Become part of the Cowboy Life Simulator community! Join our growing Discord server and be first in line for all news and updates about the game's development – straight from the developers, from the heart of the studio! Follow our social media to stay up-to-date with future plans, such as upcoming playtests, new feature additions, and future projects – don't miss out on anything!<br>", "about_the_game": "<strong>Cowboy Life Simulator</strong> is an immersive and relaxing single-player Wild West ranching simulator. Step into the boots of a stressed-out businessman who, after a failed venture, decides to change his life and buys a farm in the Wild West. Purchase your first goat and a bag of grain, get to know the local community, and explore diverse, vibrant locations.<br>Run your ranch and discover what this wild frontier has to offer!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic