e system.</li><li><strong>Light Survival</strong> – Collect resources scattered across the map and pay attention to your character's needs.</li><li><strong>Combat</strong> – Shoot various available weapons, upgrade them, and use them to fight animals and gangs terrorizing the area.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/a3f11a8c511cab00a2070fbdc5deeb22.avif?t=1788118475\" width=800 height=31 /></span><br><br>The Wild West is teeming with life, especially the small town of Bravestand. Each resident has their habits, favorite places, and problems. Make friends with them, learn the history and life of the town by helping solve the problems of your new neighbors and local residents. Help out and strengthen the bonds of friendship, and you'll gain not only good neighbors but also devoted friends!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/14c05dc98e906c8dde524433fdaab0cf.poster.avif?t=1788118475\" width=676 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/14c05dc98e906c8dde524433fdaab0cf.webm?t=1788118475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/14c05dc98e906c8dde524433fdaab0cf.mp4?t=1788118475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/7fd16b239b7eb866fe659400fba3e89a.avif?t=1788118475\" width=800 height=31 /></span><br><br>Run your ranch in your own style. You decide where your house will stand, where the goat pen will be, and where you'll sow grain and plant cabbage. Create your own corner of the Wild West with many available decorations and buildings. Run your ranch your way, take care of animals, and plant diverse crops. Trade with town residents to get new recipes and gain access to unknown resources.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/0559f9811efe3c45fc679cede1f47b1b.poster.avif?t=1788118475\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/0559f9811efe3c45fc679cede1f47b1b.webm?t=1788118475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/0559f9811efe3c45fc679cede1f47b1b.mp4?t=1788118475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/faf8b9d51965a54899659175d7abfc04.avif?t=1788118475\" width=800 height=31 /></span><br><br>And after a day's work on the ranch, pull out your revolver and hop on your horse to seek adventure in the farthest corners of the Wild West, uncovering its most hidden secrets! Find out what lurks in the abandoned mine and what's the deal with that giant rock?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/c00c9a305969774afe0a7ddf686bba05.poster.avif?t=1788118475\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/c00c9a305969774afe0a7ddf686bba05.webm?t=1788118475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151380/extras/c00c9a305969774afe0a7ddf686bba05.mp4?t=1788118475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the Cowboy Community!</h2><br>Become part of the Cowboy Lif